ATTRIBUTION
-----------

Title:      Basic symmetry information generated by httk data-generators
Creator:    Rickard Armiento
Source:     httk data-generators — https://github.com/httk/data-generator
Version:    0.1.0 (generated from commit de1f495b9e9231c8223cb20423f0d8b69b376a55)
License:    CC BY 4.0 — https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

`spacegroup_setting_transforms.json.gz` is a subset extracted from the
data-generators `transformations_hm_entry` dataset (urn:data-generators:
transformations_hm_entry/0.1.0), which carries the same title, creator, version, and
license. No values were altered in the extraction; see README.md.

Each dataset additionally carries this attribution in its own JSON-LD header, in the
`dcterms:title`, `creator`, `version`, `dcterms:license`, and `prov:wasGeneratedBy`
fields. That header is the authoritative record and is preserved verbatim.

The data were generated with the aid of cctbx (https://cctbx.github.io/) and spglib
(https://spglib.readthedocs.io/), which carry their own separate license terms.


